Error: Jet.InlineForeignOutsideUnsafe: `#FFI(asm)` needs an `#Unsafe("reason")` gate
  --> Tests/UI/ffi_asm_no_unsafe_gate.jet:3:1
    |
  3 | #FFI(asm)
    | ^^^^^^^^^
 Why: `asm` is an unsafe foreign language — an inline `asm` body can break memory safety, so Jet requires you to state why it is sound to call
 Fix: Add the gate: `#[Unsafe("…"), FFI(asm)] name: fn …`
More: jet-lang.dev/e/Jet.InlineForeignOutsideUnsafe
